MODIFICATIONS
-------------

These charts have been MODIFIED from their upstream form. As required by
Apache License 2.0 section 4(b), the changes are:

- Added `graphrag/values-graphwise.yaml`: a deployment overlay that feeds
  credentials in through Secrets materialized by the graphwise-stack umbrella
  chart, rather than through the upstream chart's own values.

Any further local delta can be reproduced by diffing this directory against the
upstream repository at the vendored chart version.
